OL,3,ANorway's royal family waves to crowds
OL,4,Afrom palace balcony after King Harald's
OL,5,Afuneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FTributes are being paid to King Harald
OL,8,FV after his funeral in Norway's capital
OL,9,FOslo, with the Prince of Wales and
OL,10,Fother European royals among attendees -
OL,11,Fwatch live coverage above
OL,13,FFlags have been raised from half-mast
OL,14,Fto mark the conclusion of a private
OL,15,Fceremony at Akershus Fortress, where
OL,16,Fthe king was laid to rest in the crypt
OL,17,Fof the Palace Chapel after a public
OL,18,Fservice at Oslo Cathedral
OL,20,FTens of thousands of people are lining
OL,21,Fthe streets to pay their respects after
OL,22,F13 days of national mourning
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
